  function v4fixOffseasonTradesV4FIX(g,phase){var off=g&&g.offseason;if(!off||!g.leagueTeams)return 0;off.v4Trades=off.v4Trades||{};var m=phase==='summer'?freeAgencyMarket(g):null,key=phase+(m?'|'+m.day:'');if(off.v4Trades[key])return 0;off.v4Trades[key]=true;var year=Number(off.year)||(Number(g.startYear)+Number(g.season)),date=phase==='summer'?m.date:year+'-06-27';var ev=runAiTradeWindow(g,{kind:'offseason',date:date,pickYear:year+1,max:phase==='summer'?2:5,label:phase==='summer'?'SUMMER TRADE':'DRAFT-WEEKEND TRADE'});return ev&&ev.deals?ev.deals.length:0;}

  // ---- Playoffs: every series is simulated and stored, whether or not Boston qualifies or survives ----
  function v4fixSeries(g,a,b){var aw=0,bw=0,chance=Math.max(.27,Math.min(.73,.5+(ratingForTeam(g,a)-ratingForTeam(g,b))*.018));while(aw<4&&bw<4){if(Math.random()<chance)aw++;else bw++;}return {a:a,b:b,aWins:aw,bWins:bw,winner:aw>bw?a:b};}
